{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13108190","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13108190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1310819001:0":{"text":"ごめんなさい、ヴェリカさん。あの人もきっとあなたの戦友だったんですよね。","source_cn":"对不起……瓦丽卡女士，他穿着和你很像的盔甲，肯定也是你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x435CD2AA2387D179","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310819002:0":{"text":"いきなり襲いかかってきたから、仕方なく……","source_cn":"满满也不想这样的，可是他突然攻击我们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74AA946AB6B3DC04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310819003:1":{"text":"謝らないで。理性を失った屍は人を襲う……分かってはいるけど、私にはとても手が下せなかったの……","source_cn":"不，不需要道歉。失去理智的活死人会攻击无辜生灵。我无法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59E03230136AD0EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310819004:0":{"text":"でも、これで彼らはようやく解放されたのよ。","source_cn":"这样对他们来说才是真正的解脱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A15651310724079","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310819005:0":{"text":"「女神よヤン・カミンスキーをお守りください」……これはお守り？","source_cn":"咦，“女神保佑扬·卡明斯基”……这似乎是个护身符？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x671E4997D86D33FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_titl